  "discussions_data": [
    {
      "id": "b6793ca929a4050e243763765445302da1e154d3",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 814445256,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I believe that (part of) the issue with that commit is that [dissect_rtcp](epan/dissectors/packet-rtcp.c#L4651) should have its last parameter `FALSE` (and `TRUE` for the SRTCP version), and then `dissect_rtcp_common` behavior should depend on the `is_srtp` parameter, not whether SRTCP is enabled or disabled. That works for Decode As.\n\nThere's still a question then of what to do for the heuristic dissector. Perhaps a preference?",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2022-01-19T04:12:28.173Z",
          "updated_at": "2022-01-19T04:12:59.969Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 134921972,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
